ok_id":"b-shiji-071","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-071-chugan"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:p013","text":"甘茂之亡秦奔齊，逢蘇代。代為齊使於秦。甘茂曰：「臣得罪於秦，懼而遯逃，無所容跡。臣聞貧人女與富人女會績，貧人女曰：『我無以買燭，而子之燭光幸有餘，子可分我餘光，無損子明而得一斯便焉。』今臣困而君方使秦而當路矣。茂之妻子在焉，願君以餘光振之。」蘇代許諾。遂致使於秦。已，因說秦王曰：「甘茂，非常士也。其居於秦，累世重矣。自殽塞及至鬼谷，其地形險易皆明知之。彼以齊約韓魏反以圖秦，非秦之利也。」秦王曰：「然則柰何？」蘇代曰：「王不若重其贄，厚其祿以迎之，使彼來則置之鬼谷，終身勿出。」秦王曰：「善。」即賜之上卿，以相印迎之於齊。甘茂不往。蘇代謂齊湣王曰：「夫甘茂，賢人也。今秦賜之上卿，以相印迎之。甘茂德王之賜，好為王臣，故辭而不往。今王何以禮之？」齊王曰：「善。」即位之上卿而處之。秦因復甘茂之家以市於齊。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m013-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"甘茂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004151","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m013-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"蘇代","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004176","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m013-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"代","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004176","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m013-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"甘茂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004151","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m013-0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"貧人女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004181","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m013-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"富人女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004182","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m013-0052","start":52,"end":55,"surface":"貧人女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004181","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m013-0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"茂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004151","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m013-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"妻子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"家屬群體、未名使者或事件名稱，不補個體及姓名；章義未按字面認作人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m013-0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":